  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759207,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1000m Zombie Escape! - Nintendo 3DS\n\n**Can you outrun the undead?**\n\nA night out takes a terrifying turn when a zombie outbreak sweeps through the city! In *1000m Zombie Escape!*, you must guide a desperately frightened character across a harrowing 1000-meter journey to reach the rescue helicopter. But there's a catch: your character is paralyzed with fear and can only rotate!\n\nNavigate the treacherous town, dodging hordes of wandering zombies in this unique and challenging action game. Initially, precise screen taps are your only means of control, demanding perfect timing to avoid becoming zombie chow. As you master the mechanics, unlock the ability to freely move your character, allowing for more skillful dodges and strategic escapes.\n\nUtilize the 3D screen to enhance the sense of depth and urgency as the relentless undead close in.  *1000m Zombie Escape!* offers a frantic, pulse-pounding experience that will test your reflexes and courage.  Will you make it to the helicopter, or become another victim of the zombie horde?"
    },
